  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisite</strong>: Tinker sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit</strong>: Increase your gizmo limit by your practitioner modifier (minimum 1). This increase is in addition to the bonus to your gizmo limit for gaining a (gizmo) feat.</p>\n<p><strong>Normal</strong>: Your gizmo limit is your ranks in the associated skill + the number of Tinker sphere talents you possess.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/gizmo-feats#toc9\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
